s since 1964. All events were considered canoe sprint events."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Only three nations won gold medals in 1964 sprint canoeing, with the Soviet Union winning three events and Germany and Sweden two each, but Romania won the most medals overall, with five – two silvers and three bronzes."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/255227"} "Kayak Singles, 1,000 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 – 22 October 1964"] "\n" [:td {} "15"] "\n" [:td {} "15"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/255240"} "Kayak Doubles, 1,000 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 – 22 October 1964"] "\n" [:td {} "28"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/255252"} "Kayak Fours, 1,000 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 – 22 October 1964"] "\n" [:td {} "56"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/255264"} "Canadian Singles, 1,000 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 – 22 October 1964"] "\n" [:td {} "11"] "\n" [:td {} "11"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/255270"} "Canadian Doubles, 1,000 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 – 22 October 1964"] "\n" [:td {} "24"] "\n" [:td {} "12"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/255276"} "Kayak Singles, 500 metres, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 – 22 October 1964"] "\n" [:td {} "13"] "\n" [:td {} "13"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/255282"} "Kayak Doubles, 500 metres, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 – 22 October 1964"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "10"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td